Wed Nov 25 16:30:00 UTC 2026 - Jordi Relats <4889953+jordirelats@users.noreply.github.com>

- Update to 0.3.1:
  * Routines run zypper with -n, so a question no longer stops them
  * "Simulate the ticked ones": programs from the web are downloaded,
    checked and simulated with the rest of the queue
  * Fixes from a review of security, zypper semantics, robustness,
    the interface and the packaging
  * AppStream metainfo; the source install uses its own polkit action

